// "Blog & Haberler" series (see header.data.ts's knowledgeMega second
// column). Unlike a dated blog feed, this and its siblings are
// timeless CATEGORY SHOWCASE pages using the same 14-section Brand
// Component Architecture as every other page this session — no
// CMS/content-collection infrastructure required.
//
